# ...except the pages the app *serves* rather than documents.
#
# Their URLs go on the Shopify App Store listing, and the app reads the
# markdown at request time — so excluding them here copies an empty directory
# and every /legal/* URL 404s in production while working perfectly in
# development. Exactly the failure modules/legal/controller.ts warns about.
#
# Every served directory needs its own negation: a new one added without a line
# here reproduces that failure exactly, and only in production.
!docs/legal/*.md
!docs/help/*.md
